Package: azidentity
Title: Azure Default Credential Authentication
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam", "Smielewski", email = "adam@blyedev.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Authors and copyright holders of the dependency Rust crates",
           role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "See LICENSE.note and the bundled crate license files")
    )
Description: Acquires Microsoft Azure OAuth 2.0 access tokens using a
    default credential chain backed by the Azure SDK for Rust. Supports
    environment credentials, workload identity, managed identity, the Azure
    CLI, and the Azure Developer CLI, with process-level credential and token
    caching.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/finccam/azure-identity-r
BugReports: https://github.com/finccam/azure-identity-r/issues
